# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (docker-compose), which runs `COPY . .`.
#
# .gitignore does not apply to Docker, so without this the image received
# .env (API keys), the local venv/, and every render in output/ and temp/.
#
# Unlike .gitignore, a pattern here with no slash matches ONLY at the context
# root — `__pycache__/` would miss services/__pycache__/. Anything that can sit
# in a subdirectory needs `**/`.
#
# Must NOT exclude models/ or music/: the Kokoro weights and music beds are
# needed at runtime.

.env
.env.*
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

output/
temp/

test_tts.py
test_voice.wav
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
